              <description>spi read state register data to this register for SPI SEQ need. SPI_MEM_NAND_FLASH_SR_DIN0_REG corresponds to SPI_MEM_NAND_FLASH_SR_ADDR0_REG.</description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>8</bitWidth>
