              <description>Write data address of OUT endpoint 0. When USB_SERIAL_JTAG_SERIAL_OUT_RECV_PKT_INT is detected, there are USB_SERIAL_JTAG_OUT_EP0_WR_ADDR-2 bytes data in OUT EP0.</description>
